      "title": "File:Barotse Floodplain (MODIS 2022-05-02).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/Barotse_Floodplain_%28MODIS_2022-05-02%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
